  <!-- %1$s: the language (speech_language_*). %2$d: share of test voice notes found first with the pack, %3$d: without it (percent). -->
  <string name="pack_speech_language_benefit">Finds what was said in %1$s voice notes and videos, which the English speech search cannot read. In our tests the right voice note came first %2$d%% of the time, against %3$d%% without it.</string>
  <string name="pack_speech_language_cost">Reads speech that is not English a second time, so those files take longer to read, and it is not perfect: expect some wrong words. English speech is read exactly as before. One speech language at a time; it needs extra memory only while it works.</string>
